cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names.
title: tesk-core
abstract: >-
  tesk-core holds the taskmaster and the filer of TESK, an implementation of
  the GA4GH Task Execution Service (TES) API on Kubernetes. The taskmaster
  runs a TES task as Kubernetes jobs: a filer job that downloads the inputs,
  one job per executor and a filer job that uploads the outputs, sharing a
  persistent volume. The filer transfers files and directories over HTTP(S),
  FTP and S3, and from and to paths on the cluster. Both are published as
  images and deployed with the Helm chart of TESK.
